@startuml
' PaymentArch · 01 System Context（C4 Level 1）
' SOURCE OF TRUTH = 本 .puml；同目录 01-system-context.svg 为渲染产物，禁止手工编辑。
' 渲染：java -jar deployment/output/tools/plantuml.jar -tsvg -o <目标目录> docs/architecture/diagrams/01-system-context.puml
' 规范：docs/standards/diagram-standard.md
!pragma layout smetana

title PaymentArch · L1 System Context —— PaymentArch 和谁交互？

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam ArrowColor #2F6FBF
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam Linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam rectangle<<person>> {
  BackgroundColor #EDEDED
  BorderColor #9E9E9E
  BorderThickness 1
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam rectangle<<system>> {
  BackgroundColor #DCE6F2
  BorderColor #5B7DA8
  BorderThickness 1
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam rectangle<<external>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8E8E8
  BorderColor #A0A0A0
  BorderThickness 1
  FontSize 12
}

rectangle "买家 / 用户\n[Person]" as Buyer <<person>>
rectangle "商户 / 运营人员\n[Person]" as Ops <<person>>

rectangle "PaymentArch\n电商与支付平台\n[Software System]\n9 个核心业务服务 + 1 个 Demo 进程" as SYS <<system>>

rectangle "支付宝开放平台（沙箱）\n[External System]\nRSA2 异步通知 / 支付指令" as Alipay <<external>>
rectangle "渠道对账账单\n[External System]\nCSV 由渠道侧提供、人工导入" as Stmt <<external>>

Buyer -r-> SYS : 下单 / 支付 / 查订单\nHTTPS
Ops -r-> SYS : 管理商品 / 订单 / 对账\nHTTPS
SYS -r-> Alipay : 发起支付指令、接收异步通知\nHTTPS · RSA2（纯文本 success）
Stmt -l-> SYS : 导入渠道账单\n文件导入（statement_imports）

legend right
  **Legend**
  Person = 浅灰 ｜ Internal Container = 蓝灰 ｜ External System = 灰 ｜ Database = 浅蓝
  连线语义：Primary Flow = Blue ｜ Success = Green ｜ Unknown = Orange ｜ Failure = Red
  关系标签格式：<动词短语> + <技术协议>
endlegend

@enduml
